Output nu.gif
Output nu.mp4
Set Shell "nu"
Set FontSize 26
Set Width 1200
Set Height 640
Set Padding 32
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 45ms
Hide
Type `cd ~/augur-gif/demo; $env.AUGUR_HOME = '/home/steven/augur-gif/rec-nu'; $env.AUGUR_CONFIG = '/home/steven/augur-gif/rec-nu/config.toml'; $env.PATH = ($env.PATH | prepend '/home/steven/augur-build/target/release'); $env.PROMPT_COMMAND = {|| 'nu demo' }; $env.PROMPT_INDICATOR = '> '; $env.PROMPT_COMMAND_RIGHT = ''; clear`
Enter
Sleep 2s
Show
